::kind(writ)

=[ Writ: floor-depends fixture ]

==[ crate-layering ]

The lowest layer may be depended on freely, but may itself depend on no
workspace member -- its whole value is being arrived at independently.

@rule(crate-layering){
  guard: { twrit: layers }

  layers: {
    0: list("base", "helper")
  }
}

`base` depends on `helper`. Both sit on the floor, so this is not an
upward edge; it is the floor reaching sideways, which the rule forbids
just the same.
